{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12231050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12231050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1223105001:0":{"text":"ああっ！私の商品が全部地面に……！これじゃあ売り物にならないぞ！","source_cn":"我的货……我的货！喔唷，全都掉到地上了！这下卖不出去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9A11A3A3569C21F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223105002:0":{"text":"薄汚いギャングどもめ！貴様らわざとだな！？","source_cn":"喂！肮脏的水鬼，你们故意的是不是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x998BA57E8BF811CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223105003:0":{"text":"せっかく仕事を与えてやったのに、これが貴様らのやり方か！？","source_cn":"我大发慈悲给你们工作的机会，你们就是这样回报我的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE485C1213FF19753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223105004:0":{"text":"ご、誤解だって！これはブラッディ・マリーが……","source_cn":"这是误会，老板。都怪血薇帮，不然货也不会弄脏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA459DFF068129D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223105005:0":{"text":"ああそうだな！タダで商品を運んでくれると言うから、本当に改心したと思ったのに、とんだ誤解だった！","source_cn":"误会？是啊！我误认为你们不收钱，是真的想改过自新！能把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9241ED9AA4FD1E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl